{"title":"Moon-Shadow Sword Emperor","synopsis":"Jujur Sungguh hidup yang malang\nWalau dia telah menjadi murid dari Heavenly Demon di tengahtengah Sekte Demonic yang penuh dengan perselisihan\nYeon SoWoon dikhianati oleh saudara seperguruannya dan mencapai ajalnya\nNamun\nSaat dia bangun dia kembali ke waktu saat dia masih kecil sebelum dia dibawa paksa ke Sekte Demonic\nBenci untuk mengulang kehidupannya yang seperti neraka di Sekte Demonic Yeon SoWoon mulai merencanakan kehidupan barunya\nAku akan balas dendam ke Sekte Demonic\nMenjadi seorang elder dari Aliansi Murim\nDan akhirnya hidup sejahtera dan dihormati","alternative_title":"월령검제","author":"Be Ingijagga","artist":"Younggeun","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"chapters":[{"id":"976b3b31-177b-4e6d-b608-bf3d83dd84b8","number":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"52e95fef-1087-4afb-afd9-6baf6a7a99ec","number":"84","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"130c846f-fb0a-48e8-a774-4bf744533572","number":"83","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"d69660e1-3c85-418a-b9f9-4cfe5e2f2c73","number":"82","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"b7ea3865-d14e-4024-8285-e8f876238fd2","number":"81","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"2ee8a22c-0744-4386-b2cd-e4f39022185d","number":"80","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2024-11-24","images":[]},{"id":"0d6b5003-84c6-4f7e-949f-ff9cb4d7bd3a","number":"79","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"cbdc0749-945f-4233-8d11-8d9ac2dbd5e7","number":"78","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"59a8d13f-0421-4af6-b4f7-79acddc07f3d","number":"77","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"dc3b89ae-9d4c-4004-973a-e4fe89e1a93e","number":"76","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"81f7e681-9f5e-46cb-a74b-4d7f7c198ea6","number":"75","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"290a27b7-b1